\v 10 “My dear girl, may Yahweh¦124770 bless¦124768 you¦124769.” \add @Boaz¦124771\add* replied¦124767, “You¦124772 have¦124772 shown more¦124775 kindness¦124773 now that before,\f + \fr 3:10 \ft Probably referring to Ruth's faithfulness to her mother-in-law.\f* because you haven't chased after¦124781 the¦124782 young¦124782 men¦124782, whether¦124783 rich¦124788 or poor¦124785.
